---
---
<footer class="foot">
  <hr class="rule" />
  <div class="shell inner">
    <div class="col">
      <p class="eyebrow">Nepali Voice Cloning</p>
      <p class="blurb">
        Multi-speaker neural voice cloning for Nepali, built on SV2TTS
        (GE2E encoder &rarr; Tacotron &rarr; WaveRNN).
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="col" aria-label="Project links">
      <p class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/AayushManShrestha/Nepali-Voice-Cloning">Source on GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="/mos">Listening study (MOS)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://huggingface.co/spaces/lord-reso/Nepali-Voice-Cloning">Model server</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UYX3VjIn17U">Demo video</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="col">
      <p class="eyebrow">Credit</p>
      <p class="blurb">
        Architecture after Jia et&nbsp;al., <em>Transfer Learning from Speaker Verification
        to Multispeaker Text-To-Speech</em>, and Corentin Jemine&rsquo;s
        Real-Time-Voice-Cloning.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="shell bottom">
    <p>Built by Aayush Man Shrestha</p>
    <p class="warnline">Please don&rsquo;t clone anyone&rsquo;s voice without their consent.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot { margin-top: auto; }
  .inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 1.5rem;
  }
  .blurb { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--step--1); margin-top: 0.6rem; max-width: 34ch; }
  .blurb em { font-style: italic; }
  ul { list-style: none; margin: 0.6rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  ul a { font-size: var(--step--1); text-decoration-color: var(--rule-strong); }

  .bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-block: 1.1rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .bottom p { margin: 0; }
  .warnline { color: var(--ink-faint); }
</style>
